Janis Papanagnou wrote:
> BanMido wrote:
>
>> I could think of boots of speed and gauntlets of power, but nothing
>> more that.

There are some times that jumping, water walking and levitation beat
speed boots.  Those go in the stash that gets shuttled down or in the
bag.  The speed boots stay on almost all of the time.

> Strength bonus from gauntlets is nice; but not really necessary.

I almost always prefer dexterity gloves to power.  Str 19/** and 25 are
not different enough for non-valks, often not different enough even for
them.

> I'd wait with the decision what to do with the rest of your wishes,
> as already said.

I rather like helm of brilliance if I have unlimited options, but keep a
couple of wishes just in case.  If a wish for a specialty item means
survival then it beats a more general item wished for earlier.


